 "name_en": "Convergent Invoicing – Recurring and One-Off Items (2T3)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Convergent Invoicing – Recurring and One-Off Items (2T3)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio39306d7a5db34714a2ec73e9fe4e4894\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio39306d7a5db34714a2ec73e9fe4e4894__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item allows the creation of billing plans in convergent invoicing. Billing plans can be used to define recurring and one-time charges for a contract or contract account.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio39306d7a5db34714a2ec73e9fe4e4894__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create billing plan for recurring and one-time charges</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Request billable items from billing plan</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio39306d7a5db34714a2ec73e9fe4e4894__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Invoice recurring charges such as a monthly contract fee</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Invoice one-time charge such as a contract activation fee</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>集中开发票 - 重复项和一次性项目 (2T3)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio39306d7a5db34714a2ec73e9fe4e4894\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio39306d7a5db34714a2ec73e9fe4e4894__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目允许在 Convergent Invoicing 中创建开票计划。开票计划可用于定义合同或合同账户的经常性费用和一次性费用。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio39306d7a5db34714a2ec73e9fe4e4894__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">为经常性费用和一次性费用创建开票计划</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">从开票计划中请求可开票项目</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio39306d7a5db34714a2ec73e9fe4e4894__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">为周期性费用开发票，例如每月合同费用</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">为一次性费用开发票，例如合同激活费用</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
